2026-10-25T10:11:20.8395390Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8791870Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8807720Z [0m
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8811120Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8811660Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8812430Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8812810Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8813510Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8814010Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8814190Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8815400Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8815720Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8816060Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8817010Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8818000Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8818290Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8818780Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8819060Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8819370Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8819560Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8819950Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8829460Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8834540Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8835050Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8838450Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8856300Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8864240Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8879900Z I will:
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8883280Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8886730Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8890250Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8891150Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8892170Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8892720Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8896830Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8900110Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8906280Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8906710Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8907630Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8911950Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8917800Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8921910Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8923350Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8936430Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8941170Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8941630Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
