2026-10-25T10:11:20.8954600Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8958870Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8962020Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-10-25T10:11:20.8964560Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
